==================================================
SECURITY REPORTING
==================================================

Security vulnerabilities should be reported privately where disclosure before remediation could create harm.

Examples:

private-key exposure

authentication bypass

authorization bypass

treasury-routing flaw

payload manipulation

agent privilege escalation

secret leakage

arbitrary contract-call injection

research-data corruption

Do not publish a working exploit against active third-party infrastructure merely to prove a point.

